N:(from Anselm Lingnau,lingnau@tm.informatik.uni-frankfurt.de) -
N:Ray Milbourne used to be the pianist in Jim Lindsay's band (if I
N:remember correctly -- it must have been long before my dancing time). He
N:was famous for his compositions of Scottish-style tunes with, er,
N:idiosyncratic harmonies
